<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Tan &amp; Tan year net up 19 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Tan &amp; Tan year net up 19 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Jan. 31, 1997</p>
<p>		 (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		56.29	   vs	 47.21</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)     17.6	    vs	 14.8</p>
<p>    Turnover		 369.81	   vs	294.18</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	  83.02	   vs	 67.85</p>
<p>    Minorities    less     2.53	   vs  less  2.52</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	 26.59	   vs	  6.20</p>
<p>NOTE - Company's full name is tan &amp; Tan Developements Bhd. It is involved in property development.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 201 4813)</p>
</text>
